# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: installs every TORCS tracks package.
Package: TORCS-Tracks
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-torcs
Environment: any
Depends: TORCS, TORCS-Tracks-DirtOval, TORCS-Tracks-Road1, TORCS-Tracks-Road2, TORCS-Tracks-Road3
Description: All 29 extra tracks for TORCS
 Installs the four TORCS track packages, so all 38 tracks of Debian's
 free-software TORCS 1.3.7 are there (the main package has 9). About
 310 MB to download, 400 MB on disc.
Build-Meta: yes
Build-Notice: TORCS tracks, packaged for PackMan from the tracks pack on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-torcs/releases
 .
 The tracks are part of TORCS's game data (Debian's torcs 1.3.7+dfsg),
 under the licences given in TORCS's copyright file, which follows.
Build-Copyright: TORCS-1.3.7-riscos3.zip::!TORCS/Licences/TORCS-data
